{
  "api": 1,
  "id": "claude-code",
  "name": "Claude Code",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "Disled",
  "icon": "terminal",
  "description": {
    "fr": "Montre sur la lampe ce que fait Claude Code : il travaille, il attend votre réponse ou il a fini. Une alerte vous prévient aussi quand il vous attend.",
    "en": "Shows on the lamp what Claude Code does: it works, it waits for your answer, or it is done. An alert also tells you when it waits for you."
  },
  "capabilities": [
    "color",
    "alert",
    "events"
  ],
  "states": [
    {
      "id": "waiting",
      "label": {
        "fr": "Claude attend votre réponse",
        "en": "Claude waits for your answer"
      },
      "color": "orange",
      "priority": 3,
      "ttl": 1800
    },
    {
      "id": "working",
      "label": {
        "fr": "Claude travaille",
        "en": "Claude is working"
      },
      "color": "red",
      "priority": 2,
      "ttl": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "done",
      "label": {
        "fr": "Claude a fini",
        "en": "Claude is done"
      },
      "color": "green",
      "priority": 1,
      "ttl": 1800
    }
  ],
  "idle": "done",
  "events": {
    "from": "Claude Code",
    "key": "/session_id",
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {
          "/hook_event_name": "SessionEnd"
        },
        "clear": true
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "/hook_event_name": "PreToolUse",
          "/tool_name": [
            "AskUserQuestion",
            "ExitPlanMode"
          ]
        },
        "state": "waiting",
        "alert": true
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "/hook_event_name": [
            "PermissionRequest",
            "Elicitation",
            "StopFailure"
          ]
        },
        "state": "waiting",
        "alert": true
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "/hook_event_name": "Stop",
          "/background_tasks": {
            "nonEmpty": true
          }
        },
        "state": "working"
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "/hook_event_name": "Stop"
        },
        "state": "done"
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "/hook_event_name": "Notification"
        },
        "ignore": true
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "/hook_event_name": [
            "UserPromptSubmit",
            "PreToolUse",
            "PostToolUse",
            "PostToolUseFailure",
            "ElicitationResult"
          ]
        },
        "state": "working"
      }
    ]
  },
  "note": {
    "text": {
      "fr": [
        "Claude Code prévient Disled par des « hooks » : ajoutez ce bloc à `~/.claude/settings.json`, dans votre dossier personnel.",
        "Le fichier a déjà une clé « hooks » ? Ajoutez-y ces entrées sans effacer les vôtres. Claude Code les prend en compte sans redémarrer."
      ],
      "en": [
        "Claude Code tells Disled through “hooks”: add this block to `~/.claude/settings.json`, in your home folder.",
        "The file has a “hooks” key already? Add these entries to it without removing yours. Claude Code takes them into account without a restart."
      ]
    },
    "file": "settings.json",
    "block": {
      "hooks": {
        "UserPromptSubmit": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "http",
                "url": "{{url}}",
                "headers": {
                  "X-Disled-Token": "{{token}}"
                },
                "timeout": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "PreToolUse": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "http",
                "url": "{{url}}",
                "headers": {
                  "X-Disled-Token": "{{token}}"
                },
                "timeout": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "PostToolUse": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "http",
                "url": "{{url}}",
                "headers": {
                  "X-Disled-Token": "{{token}}"
                },
                "timeout": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "PostToolUseFailure": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "http",
                "url": "{{url}}",
                "headers": {
                  "X-Disled-Token": "{{token}}"
                },
                "timeout": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "PermissionRequest": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "http",
                "url": "{{url}}",
                "headers": {
                  "X-Disled-Token": "{{token}}"
                },
                "timeout": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "Elicitation": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "http",
                "url": "{{url}}",
                "headers": {
                  "X-Disled-Token": "{{token}}"
                },
                "timeout": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "ElicitationResult": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "http",
                "url": "{{url}}",
                "headers": {
                  "X-Disled-Token": "{{token}}"
                },
                "timeout": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "Stop": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "http",
                "url": "{{url}}",
                "headers": {
                  "X-Disled-Token": "{{token}}"
                },
                "timeout": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "StopFailure": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "http",
                "url": "{{url}}",
                "headers": {
                  "X-Disled-Token": "{{token}}"
                },
                "timeout": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "SessionEnd": [
          {
            "hooks": [
              {
                "type": "http",
                "url": "{{url}}",
                "headers": {
                  "X-Disled-Token": "{{token}}"
                },
                "timeout": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
